@startuml
title UC-16 - Manage workload configuration (conceptual)
autonumber
actor Developer as Dev
boundary "Workload configuration UI" as UI
control "Workload configuration" as Config
entity "Reference catalog" as Catalog
database "Desired configuration store" as Store

Dev -> UI: Select Application/Environment [MS-01]
UI -> Config: List workload configurations
Config -> Store: Read desired workload state
Store --> UI: Workloads + pending changes
Dev -> UI: Add/Edit, form or Score import [MS-02]
UI -> Catalog: List eligible references [MS-03..MS-05]
Catalog --> UI: UC-12 keys, resource inputs/outputs, Services/ports
Dev -> UI: Choose references, public paths and save [MS-04..MS-07]
UI -> Config: Validate and save desired configuration
Config -> Catalog: Verify scope, output class, Service/port [MS-06]
Catalog --> Config: Validated references
Config -> Store: Save pending change [MS-07]
Store --> UI: Pending status
UI --> Dev: Preview changes available (UC-05)

alt Delete workload [VAR-02]
  Dev -> UI: Confirm deletion
  UI -> Config: Mark pending deletion
  Config -> Store: Save pending deletion
  Store --> UI: Pending status + Undo
end
@enduml
